==Battleground==
*3 [[Gabriel]]s (200%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s (200%) spawn after 11.33 seconds<sup>340f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s (200%) spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gabriel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s (200%) spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Sleipnir]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen]] to tank and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|C. Bahamut]] to handle the Slepnirs, as Bahamut outranges them. Ramen can struggle against a horde of Angelic Gories, so you might need to bring some meatshields to help out Ramen.

